efore converting.\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-description-text\":\"Text on each selected shape will be used as the description field in Jira.\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-empty-shapes-v2\":\"The shapes selected have an empty text field. To create Jira work items, text on shape is used as the 'summary' in Jira which is a required field.\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-next-button\":\"Next\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-summary\":\"Summary\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-summary-description\":\"Text on each selected shape will be used as the summary field in Jira.\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-summary-exceeds-limit\":\"One or more selected shapes have summaries exceeding Jira's limit of {limit} characters. Shorten the summary text before converting.\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-title-v2.one\":\"Convert {count} shape to Jira work item\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-title-v2.other\":\"Convert {count} shapes to Jira work items\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-too-many-shapes\":\"We cannot convert more than {count} shapes at a time. Please select fewer shapes and try again.\",\"jira-callout-mapping-fields-onboarding\":\"Optimize your Jira integration by mapping data fields to Lucid.\",\"jira-cards-highlight-fields-description\":\"Manage your Lucid Cards for Jira settings here.\",\"jira-cards-spotlight-description-v4\":\"Lucid cards for Jira accelerates your agile planning. Easily create, import, and update Jira work items directly in Lucidspark.\",\"jira-cards-spotlight-header-v2\":\"Elevate your planning and roadmapping with Lucid Cards for Jira\",\"jira-cards-spotlight-primary-button-v3\":\"Import Jira work items\",\"jira-configure-fields-prompt-cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"jira-configure-fields-prompt-description\":\"Optimize your Jira integration by mapping data fields to Lucid.\",\"jira-configure-fields-prompt-primary-button-v2\":\"Map data\",\"jira-configure-fields-prompt-title\":\"Map your Jira fields to Lucid\",\"jira-conversion-converting-work-item-growl.one\":\"Converting Jira work item...\"