 denied\",\"pull-request-callout-go-to-approval-requests\":\"Go to approval requests\",\"pull-request-compare-changes\":\"Compare changes\",\"pull-request-direct-publish-disabled-tooltip\":\"You must be the owner of this document to publish or submit it for approval\",\"pull-request-empty-document-publish\":\"This document is empty. Add content to the canvas before requesting approval.\",\"pull-request-needs-work-v2\":\"Deny\",\"pull-request-no-changes-to-publish\":\"There are no unapproved changes in this document. Make changes before requesting approval.\",\"pull-request-publish\":\"Publish\",\"pull-request-publish-directly\":\"Publish directly\",\"pull-request-publish-failure-growl\":\"We couldn’t publish your draft due to an error. Please try again or contact support.\",\"pull-request-publish-failure-growl-link\":\"Contact support.\",\"pull-request-publish-tooltip-v2\":\"Publish document\",\"pull-request-request-approval\":\"Request approval\",\"pull-request-request-approval-disabled-tooltip\":\"You must be the owner of this document to submit it for approval\",\"pull-request-request-approval-tooltip\":\"Send this document to reviewers for approval.\",\"pull-request-review-controls-draft-mode-tooltip\":\"This approval request has been withdrawn while the author makes edits.\",\"pull-request-review-controls-request-denied-by-other-reviewers-tooltip\":\"Another reviewer has denied this request.\",\"quick-action-convert-to-jira-work-item\":\"Convert to Jira work items\",\"remove-group-screen-reader-text\":\"Shape library group removed.\",\"repository-branch-confirm-text-v3\":\"To suggest edits to this document, you'll need to create a draft.\\nYour draft will appear in your documents list, where you can make changes before submitting it for review.\",\"repository-branch-confirm-title\":\"Create a draft to edit\",\"repository-branch-confirm-yes\":\"Create draft\",\"repository-branch-default-name\":\"Draft of <w0>{originalName}</w0>\",\"repository-direct-publish-over